# Runtime + test dependencies, mirroring [project.dependencies] and the test
# extra. The python_version markers are kept: this matrix spans 3.10 to 3.13
# and agentrust-trace is 3.11+, so the lock has to carry the condition rather
# than resolve it away. Installed with --require-hashes before the local
# package goes in with --no-deps, because pip cannot hash-pin an editable
# install in the same invocation. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/test.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.10 -o requirements/test.txt
